<title>FRANCE: BNP increases its Dexia rating - fund managers.</title>
<headline>BNP increases its Dexia rating - fund managers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>BNP has increased its rating of Dexia to &quot;accumulate&quot; from &quot;underweight&quot; after the bank bought 40 pct in Italy's Crediop, fund managers said.</p>
<p>BNP did not change its profit forecasts, they added.</p>
<p>At 1537 GMT, Dexia was up 4.13 percent at 555 francs</p>
</text>
